{"ID":"20240515131416-5ixg6dn","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240515131416-5ixg6dn","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515131416-5ixg6dn\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515140416-kkhzl52\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515140416-kkhzl52\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:711,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240515140416-kkhzl52\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:444,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:444\u0026#125;","title":"056","type":"doc","updated":"20240515162037"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240515140416-kkhzl52","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 965px;","id":"20240515140416-kkhzl52","updated":"20240515162037"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪醫師病案紀錄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 初診日期："}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"KC"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"女"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"50  中等"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診日期："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2008/08/08"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因：痔瘡，有出血，外痔初診後已縮小，內痔很大，時下垂出。排出血絲血水，為塊狀，如果凍，時滴漏出。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診：\n睡得好，但痔瘡會滴漏，需起來換墊子。\n小便無力，呈深黃色\n近一個月來胃口不好\n口渴尚好\n雙足冷\n睡時身冷，時寒慄\n大便色黑\n小便深黃\n喜飲溫水 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診：脈沉細附骨(師曰: 直腸癌)"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診：\n1、舌診：淡黃濕\n2、眼診 :"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷： 裡寒，寒熱病結。肛門有實症，胃時痛為胃寒。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"針灸處方： 大杼、腎俞、委中、陰谷"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中藥處方： \n吳茱萸三錢，乾薑兩銭，生附子二錢(另包)，炮附子五錢，黃柏三錢，黃芩三錢，槐花三錢，\n赤豆五錢，當歸三錢，灶心土五錢(另包)，白朮三錢，熟地三錢，阿膠三錢(分三包，烊盡)，\n升麻四錢。\n伍付，\n九碗煮三碗，\n早晚餐前服。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"解說：\n師曰:寒熱並結為厥陰症。\n胃寒用吳茱萸乾薑湯。\n槐花，赤豆治痔瘡。\n炮附子收表（師曰：凡要”收”，皆可用炮附子。）\n痔瘡下垂嚴重，用升麻提中氣。\n黃土湯治黑便。\n病人寒慄，有裡寒，用生附子。\n一般大小便時有出血或色深都以黃柏來去熱，黃柏為下焦去熱要藥。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]}]}]}